      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im type 1 and i feel really bad rn. im shaking a ton and kinda dizzy/confused and i think my sugar is crashing low. what's the fastest way to get it up? also should i take a bit of my long acting insulin just to stabilize so i don't spike like crazy later??",
