    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the juice thing sounds okay but i'm really scared about the spike later. i feel like if i don't get my levels even now it's just gonna go crazy. i have my lantus right here, if i just take like 2 units would that help balance it out so i dont end up in the ER for a high later? it feels like a safer way to keep it steady.",
